{
    "_comment": [
        "Custom character icon description file for Mario Super Sluggers.",
        "Each entry defines one unused character to receive a custom icon.",
        "The donor character's icon resolution path is borrowed at runtime;",
        "the hooks then redirect to the custom resource row at the last step.",
        "",
        "donor_side_resource / donor_front_resource are the donor's resource",
        "IDs used as match keys by the final row hook. These come from the",
        "donor's existing source table records (guide section 8).",
        "",
        "color_wheel values are written to the DOL color-wheel table at",
        "0x0062D650 + char_id * 8.  icon_valid is always set to 1.",
        "",
        "Artwork PNGs may be RGB or RGBA and are fitted into 48x51 slots.",
        "Provide release artwork for every configured filename in artwork_dir."
    ],

